{# Bail application under BNSS 2023 (CrPC equivalent cited for the transition period). #}
@court IN THE {{ court_name | upper }}
@center {{ court_location | upper }}
@center BAIL APPLICATION NO. ______ OF {{ date.year }}
@space
@heading IN THE MATTER OF:
{% for a in applicants %}
@left {{ loop.index }}. {{ party_line(a) }}
{% endfor %}
@right ... {{ A }}
@center VERSUS
@left {{ state_name }}
@right ... Respondent
@space
@left FIR No.: {{ fir_number }}{% if fir_date %} dated {{ fir_date | short_date }}{% endif %}
@left Police Station: {{ police_station }}
@left Under: {{ sections }}
@space
@title APPLICATION UNDER {{ section | upper }}{% if old_section %} (ERSTWHILE {{ old_section | upper }}){% endif %} FOR GRANT OF {% if anticipatory %}ANTICIPATORY {% else %}REGULAR {% endif %}BAIL ON BEHALF OF THE {{ A | upper }}
@para MOST RESPECTFULLY SHOWETH:
@heading BRIEF FACTS
{% for f in facts %}
@num That {{ f | lc_first }}
{% endfor %}
{% if custody_days is not none %}
@num That the {{ A }} {{ A_is }} in judicial custody since {{ custody_since | short_date }}, i.e. for {{ custody_days }} days as on date.
{% endif %}
{% if not anticipatory %}
@num That the charge-sheet {{ "has been filed" if chargesheet_filed else "has not yet been filed" }} in the present case.
{% endif %}
@heading GROUNDS
@para The {{ A }} seeks bail, inter alia, on the following grounds, which are without prejudice to one another:
{% for g in grounds %}
@sub {{ g }}
{% endfor %}
@num That {% if previous_applications %}the details of previous bail applications are as follows: {{ previous_applications }}{% else %}no other bail application on behalf of the {{ A }} has been filed or is pending before this Hon'ble Court, the Hon'ble High Court of Delhi or the Hon'ble Supreme Court of India in the present FIR{% endif %}.
@num That the {{ A }} {{ A_is }} ready to furnish {{ surety_offer }}, and undertake{{ "" if applicants | length > 1 else "s" }} to abide by any condition(s) imposed by this Hon'ble Court.
@heading PRAYER
@para It is, therefore, most respectfully prayed that this Hon'ble Court may be pleased to:
{% if anticipatory %}
@sub direct that in the event of arrest, the {{ A }} be released on bail in FIR No. {{ fir_number }}, P.S. {{ police_station }}, under {{ sections }};
{% else %}
@sub release the {{ A }} on regular bail in FIR No. {{ fir_number }}, P.S. {{ police_station }}, under {{ sections }}, during the pendency of the trial;
{% endif %}
@sub pass any other order(s) as this Hon'ble Court may deem fit and proper in the interest of justice.
@space
@right {{ A | upper }}
@right Through
@right {{ advocate_name }}{% if advocate_enrolment %} ({{ advocate_enrolment }}){% endif %}
@right Counsel for the {{ A }}
@left Place: {{ place }}
@left Date: {{ date | short_date }}
